# Allow-list: this repository is the workspace root; every other folder in it (engine fork, Suzie, external tools,
# the user's game data and key file, dev project, logs) is ignored.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/DBD-MODKIT-README.md
!/docs/
!/tools/
!/Profiles/
!/Packaging/

/Profiles/*/Plugin/*/Binaries/
/Profiles/*/Plugin/*/Intermediate/
/Profiles/*/data/golden/
__pycache__/
/Profiles/*/sweeps/
!/LICENSE
